                <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; color: var(--p-text-color);">Vertical</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--p-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Default layout is horizontal; use <code style="font-family: var(--p-font-mono);">orientation="vertical"</code> for vertical audio fader channels.</p>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 3rem; align-items: flex-end; padding: 1rem 0; min-height: 14rem;">
